      <shape width="716.6159842519685" height="62.8" topLeftX="175.67999999999995" topLeftY="442.08" type="text" id="bVD">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(234, 242, 248, 1)" fontSize="13.0" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">语义解码目前仍是 proof of principle；真正临床可用的版本，需要把同样的能力搬到 EEG / ECoG / iEEG 上做实时解码。</span></strong></p>
